1
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:23,020
Four fairies Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter meet together.

2
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:28,360
Winter says:

3
00:00:29,370 --> 00:00:32,860
Sister Spring is loved by everyone.

4
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:40,100
She comes back, trees sprout and grow.

5
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:43,850
Spring says:

6
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:59,700
Must have Sister Summer's sunshine, trees in garden bear sweet fruit, children get summer vacation.

7
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:03,540
Sister Summer says:

8
00:01:04,210 --> 00:01:07,810
Children like Sister Autumn most.

9
00:01:09,150 --> 00:01:25,490
Autumn makes grape garden ripe golden, full moon night with lanterns, feast.

10
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:31,520
Sister Winter, sad voice:

11
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:38,730
Only you no one loves.

12
00:01:40,250 --> 00:01:45,240
Autumn puts hand on Winter's shoulder, comforts:

13
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:50,840
With you there is warm sleep in blanket.

14
00:01:51,010 --> 00:01:54,940
Why would anyone not like you?

15
00:01:56,580 --> 00:02:06,220
Four fairies chat happily, not knowing Mother Earth has come beside.

16
00:02:06,830 --> 00:02:09,900
She says:

17
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:21,730
Each of you has own beauty, all of you are useful, all are lovable.

